{
  "name": "needs-shift-cycle-visual",
  "description": "Visual check of shift cycle: build living_quarters tier 2+ to activate 8-tick shift cycle, set policy to shift_8h mode, then advance ticks to verify employees work 6 ticks then auto-enter 8-tick sleep rest; state dump should show restTicksRemaining during rest and ticksWorked reset on completion",
  "steps": [
